# Saaniya Software LLC Branding

## Company name

- Legal / public company name: **Saaniya Software LLC**
- Short public brand: **Saaniya Software**
- Never use **NAS**, **Neeraj's AI Software**, or **Neeraj's AI Services** as the company name on public-facing copy
- Product attribution uses the full name: `SISLMS by Saaniya Software LLC`, not `by NAS`
- Never publish personal names (**Dr. Neeraj Agrawal**, founder/CEO bylines) on public pages — use **Saaniya Software** / **Saaniya Software LLC** instead

## Logo

- Canonical logo file: `assets/Saaniyalogo.png` (source: `OneDrive/AI/Saaniyalogo.png`)
- Use for favicon, nav, og:image, brochure headers, and any company mark
- Alt text: `Saaniya Software LLC Logo`
- Do **not** use `NASlogonew.png`, `GurukulbyNASlogo.png`, or other NAS company logos for the company brand
- Product logos (GuruVidyaZen, SISLMS, etc.) stay product-specific

## Do not rename

- Domains and emails: `nasneeraj.com`, `saaniyasoftware@nasneeraj.com`, product subdomains
- Internal filenames that are URLs/paths unless explicitly migrating (e.g. `NAS_BROCHURE.html`)
- Video asset filenames (e.g. `NAS-promo.mp4`) unless re-encoding/rebranding the media

## When editing any repo

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<img src="assets/NASlogonew.png" alt="NAS Logo">
<span>NAS</span>
<p>Dr. Neeraj Agrawal, Founder & CEO</p>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<img src="assets/Saaniyalogo.png" alt="Saaniya Software LLC Logo">
<span>Saaniya Software LLC</span>
<p>Saaniya Software</p>
```

If a repo still says NAS, shows a personal founder name, or points at `NASlogonew.png`, replace all in the same change.
